{
  "contractVersion": 1,
  "kind": "test-vectors",
  "subject": "master-seed",
  "notes": [
    "MASTER_SEED (secrets.json) is the root of the keys an instance derives. These vectors hold both implementations to the three things that come out of it: which text is a seed, which dht-node identity a seed derives, and the delegation the community key signs for that identity.",
    "The derivation is SLIP-10 through gradido-blockchain-core, one hardened step at MASTER_SEED_PATH_DHT (const.json). Both paths call the same C function, so what a derive vector pins is the binding and the index around it rather than two implementations of SLIP-10.",
    "The delegation is libp2p-ffi's format, and every delegation below was signed by libp2p-ffi itself (lp2p_delegation_sign, v0.1.2) when the file was written, and every dhtNodeKey and communityKey computed by its lp2p_key_from_seed: the vectors say what the network accepts, not what either implementation believes. ed25519 signatures are deterministic, so a delegation is an exact value.",
    "A delegate vector's community private key is communitySeed followed by communityKey -- the 64 bytes communities.private_key holds.",
    "No regenerator: every derived value is recomputed by both runners and compared, and the values came from the oracles named above."
  ],
  "rules": {
    "pathDht": {
      "type": "uint32",
      "value": "6580340",
      "note": "MASTER_SEED_PATH_DHT in const.json: the ASCII bytes of `dht`, 0x00646874."
    },
    "seedBytes": {
      "type": "uint32",
      "value": "32",
      "note": "MASTER_SEED_BYTES in const.json."
    }
  },
  "fields": {
    "id": {
      "type": "text",
      "note": "Stable forever. A failure names this."
    },
    "why": {
      "type": "text",
      "note": "What this vector is load bearing for."
    },
    "kind": {
      "type": "text",
      "note": "parse, derive or delegate: which of the three a vector tests, and so which of the fields below it carries."
    },
    "text": {
      "type": "text",
      "nullable": true,
      "note": "parse: the value as MASTER_SEED holds it."
    },
    "masterSeed": {
      "type": "bytes",
      "nullable": true,
      "note": "derive and delegate: 32 bytes."
    },
    "communitySeed": {
      "type": "bytes",
      "nullable": true,
      "note": "delegate: the community's 32-byte ed25519 seed."
    },
    "expiresMs": {
      "type": "uint64",
      "unit": "unix_milliseconds",
      "nullable": true,
      "note": "delegate: 0 is never."
    },
    "expect.accepted": {
      "type": "bool",
      "nullable": true,
      "note": "parse: whether the text is a master seed. The contract."
    },
    "expect.dhtNodeSeed": {
      "type": "bytes",
      "nullable": true,
      "note": "derive: the 32-byte seed libp2p-ffi takes as node_seed."
    },
    "expect.dhtNodeKey": {
      "type": "bytes",
      "nullable": true,
      "note": "derive and delegate: the node's ed25519 public key."
    },
    "expect.communityKey": {
      "type": "bytes",
      "nullable": true,
      "note": "delegate: the community's public key."
    },
    "expect.delegation": {
      "type": "bytes",
      "nullable": true,
      "note": "delegate: the 136 bytes, exactly."
    }
  },
  "count": 13,
